WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.850
Who's that woman?

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:05.350
See you later!

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.270
Be careful!

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.320
Endo... Hey, Endo!

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.830
Are you asleep?

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.540
"See you later"...

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.580
--"See you later," she said?!

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.960
--Saya!
--"See you later," she said?!

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.250
Unforgivable...!

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.220
Hey, Coconuts. Let's play
games at my place today.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:33.920
Sure.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:35.930
Okay, then. Let's go home, Saya.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:41.720
Sorry, I have something to do today.
Um, I've got after-school activities!

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:42.520
Huh...?

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:47.020
Wait, you have after-school activities...?

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.610
I must ascertain...

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:22.370
...the identity of that woman.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.470
If she's a conniving woman 
tricking Coconuts into

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:28.120
letting her stay with 
him, I have to save him.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.000
If that's really the case...

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.840
--both his body and soul could
belong to that woman by now.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.550
"You can call me Mommy."

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.800
--You can call me Mommy.
--both his body and soul could
belong to that woman by now.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:40.760
"You can call me Mommy."
"Mommy!"

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.840
Mommy!

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:40.760
I'm kinda curious...

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:45.100
Wait, no! I'm not gonna allow that!

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.140
Hey! I'm coming in!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.160
Is she asleep?

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.490
Err... Hello?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.660
Yeeees! I wasn't asleep!

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:18.420
Ow! I banged my head pretty good!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.180
A-A customer!

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.180
Welcome!

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.680
I was finally able to say it...
I started to think no one would ever come.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.180
"W-Welcome"?

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:33.350
Hm? Oh, are you possibly
Manager Kokonotsu's acquaintance?

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.190
Kinda...

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.150
I'm Hajime Owari!
I'm a new part-time worker here!

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.360
A part-timer?

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:44.320
Kokonotsu said that he wanted someone
to watch the shop while he is at school.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.820
A part-timer?!

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:49.410
That asshole! Hiring a part-timer
when he's got me...?!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.120
On top of that, he hires a woman?!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.830
Kokonotsu sure has it tough, doesn't he?

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.920
What? You're leaving?

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.920
You came all the way here.
Please buy something.

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:03.430
I didn't come here to buy anything, so...

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.680
What? Oh, then you came to see the manager?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:10.180
Ah! Are you his girlfriend by any chance?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:15.600
Wh-What? No... Does it look that way?
It's not like that, but...

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:17.020
...does it look that way to you?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:20.690
"Shikada Dagashi"

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:20.210
Well, I did come all the way here,
so I might as well buy something!

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:24.450
Let's see... A snack that'd
be perfect for his girlfriend...

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.490
This! This one's good!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:30.450
"Roll Candy"

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.450
This is Roll Candy! Thirty-five yen!

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.340
What kind of snack is it?

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:38.250
The manager said, "It seems that this
one is pretty popular these days."

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:40.630
He's dedicated to work, isn't he?

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.130
Err... Thanks!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:44.470
Oh? You're opening it now, huh?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.620
Um...

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.470
This thing is totally rolled up...

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:50.890
What the heck is this?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.180
I wonder if you just eat the
whole thing in one bite.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.280
Huh?

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:59.230
What? Is this paper-like thing edible?

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.330
Maybe not, huh?

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.780
You work here, don't you?!
You should know this stuff!

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.990
I'm sorry, but today is my first day, so...!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:15.000
Wait! By that argument, you're close to
the manager! You should know it, too, right?!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.420
It's true we're close, but...

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.250
Argh, screw it! I guess 
we just have to unroll it!

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.260
Ready?!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.260
Yes!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.050
Th-There it is!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.220
And it even looks like
you can peel the candy off!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.850
Good thing you didn't eat the paper.

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.020
I get it! I figured out how to eat it!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.770
So grab this part...

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.020
Hm? What?!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.860
Bite the edge of it...

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.000
Right!

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.610
And I'll hold this end.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:50.910
Are you ready?

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:51.870
Mm-hmm!

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.870
Hiya!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.960
We did it...

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.130
We did.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.960
But you could've done it by yourself, huh?

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.380
Yeah, I could have.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.510
I'm back.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.100
Oh, you're here too, Saya? Welcome.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.690
Welcome back, Manager.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:20.900
How was your first day?

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:26.150
Well, it tired me out.
But dagashi are pretty interesting.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:29.200
"When all she did was sleep..."

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.200
I don't quite get it, but I'm glad
you feel they're interesting.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.410
I'll take over now, so you can call it a day.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.910
All right!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.160
Thank you!

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:40.080
But well, she doesn't seem to be a
bad person, so... I guess it's okay.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.130
Ah, then, is it okay to take a bath now?

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:47.550
Well, I didn't take one yesterday, so...

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:50.430
What? Please take one every day.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.340
Then I'll take one first!

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.510
Coconuts...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.430
Hm?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:56.180
I thought she was a part-timer.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:00.190
Yeah. She's a live-in worker,
which really helps.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.940
I see... Live-in, huh?

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.150
What the hell...?!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.400
H-Huh?!

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.470
What I'm really into lately is...

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:15.160
...playing debt collector with Coconuts.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:19.290
And it is pretty fun.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.330
So I'm gonna do it again today.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.940
In this kind of game,
how you start is important.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.420
"Cocoa Cigarette"

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:31.010
If you feel self-conscious and don't really
go all out, then it's no fun at all.

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.680
So you've gotta fully commit to it!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:37.930
Mr. Shikada... Our patience is running thin.
It's time for you to pay the piper.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.390
If you don't pony up the cash...

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.440
...you're in for a whole lotta-- Huh?

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.780
Oh crap!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:53.240
I just spoke to a total stranger like she's
my buddy! This is so embarrassing!

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:56.410
Wait... Who's she?

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.280
Aw man...

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.490
Um...

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.620
Does Kokonotsu really have such a huge debt?

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.000
Oh? Is she following my lead?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.510
Is she a nice lady who's
playing along with my game?

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:15.050
The manager stepped out for groceries,
so please come back some other time.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:19.680
She's being kind enough to go along with it.
I need to get my act together!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.020
"She's going along with it!"

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.060
I need to give this all I've got!

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.770
"Shikada Dagashi"

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.270
"Come back some other time"?

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:32.280
I hear that same line every single time.
I can't keep going back empty-handed.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.150
B-But...

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:36.870
Oh, yeah. You'll do just fine, lady.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:37.570
What?!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.660
How about you pay with your body?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.550
W-With my body?!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.460
Please spare me!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.420
I'm so unhealthy that no one will want me!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:55.840
Even so, it's not like we're
running a charity here.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.010
What can I do?

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:59.050
Let's see...

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.720
Then, lady... I want you to...

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:03.020
You want me to...

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:07.090
...do something funny.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.650
Something funny?

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.290
G-Glasses... Glasses...

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.540
Where'd my glasses go?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.420
Where're my glasses?

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.670
Oh, here they are.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.550
That's...!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.550
Yeah! I can see great now!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.340
That's the one called
chocolate glasses or something

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.550
that tends to be put near the
registers at grocery stores!

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:42.560
Th-This lady's...

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.560
Not bad!

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:47.060
On top of that, when you're hungry...

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.060
...you can...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.330
...eat chocolate like this, too!

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:54.070
Th-This is super fun!

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:57.110
That's cool! I wanna do it, too!

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:58.240
Was that good?

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.320
It was!

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.580
I'll buy ten of them!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.830
I'm gonna brag about this
to my friends tomorrow!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.960
Thanks! I'll come again!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:09.830
Thanks.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.090
Somehow, I got through it...

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.340
"Shikada Dagashi"

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.800
I'm back!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:20.590
Hm...?

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:21.100
What the...?!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.600
Wh-What's wrong, Hajime?!
Get a hold of yourself!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.310
Kokonotsu...

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.600
Y-Yes?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:29.770
I will...

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.610
protect this shop!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.820
H-Huh?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:38.030
"Roll Candy, High Eight Chocolate, and..."

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:37.400
I will protect it!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:16.510
"Next time: Internets, Super Ball, and..."

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:12.290
Next time. "Internets, Super Ball, and..."

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.170
Please leave it to me!
